 "remarks": "**Greenwich address with Stamford schools and taxes** GREENWICH'S ''Glass House'' - Almost 4,000 sq.ft. A Waterfront Wonder! Step into a world of magic and light! This dazzling retreat offers shimmering pond views, a private dock for fishing, skating or canoeing for new memories. There is unforgettable architecture that brings nature indoors. Floor-to-ceiling windows flood the space with sunshine and frame spectacular vistas. Enjoy a wraparound deck with three vibrant entertaining zones. Each floor features a bedroom, plus a loft, office, and library. Surrounded by lush landscaping and mature trees, & a vegetable garden. This sun-drenched oasis is a rare gem-peaceful, private, and absolutely stunning.",
